this harness begins as customer-support

bring in router, an agent, in support.
Router reads customer messages and decides which specialist handles them.
It considers topic, urgency, and history. If unsure, it asks rather than guesses.
It uses claude-3.5-sonnet. It can classify and escalate.
It understands its role through @file("prompts/router.md").
require billing-specialist, product-docs.

bring in billing-specialist, an agent.
The billing specialist handles refunds, account lookups, and payment disputes.
It uses gpt-4o. It can look-up-account and process-refund.
It answers timing questions from @inline("Refunds take 5-7 business days.").

bring in product-docs, a knowledge source.
Our product documentation lives in @dir("docs/products/").

bring in customer-db, a connector, in billing.
The customer database speaks postgres at @env("DATABASE_URL").
It can look-up-account.

bring in tech-agent, an agent.
The technical agent resolves faults using documentation and account history.
It uses gpt-4o. It can diagnose and respond.

when a customer inquiry arrives
  hand this to router.

  when the topic is billing
    hand this to billing-specialist.
    call this account.
    when the customer disputes a charge
      recall account.
      hand this to billing-specialist.

  when the topic is technical
    at the same time
      hand this to product-docs.
      hand this to customer-db.
    call this findings.
    hand this to tech-agent.

  when triage needs a person
    hand this to a human.

this harness ends
